00:33:51.792 --> 00:33:53.750
PATRICK LORTON: And I
will end it on that note.

00:33:53.750 --> 00:33:55.750
Thank you very much
for watching today.

00:33:55.750 --> 00:33:57.970
I hope I didn't bore you
too much with science.

00:33:57.970 --> 00:34:00.825
There's a ton of people I
should thank, by the way.

00:34:00.825 --> 00:34:02.950
A bunch of our solution
architects helped this out,

00:34:02.950 --> 00:34:06.260
and obviously, the whole company
built most of the software.

00:34:06.260 --> 00:34:08.100
Thank you very much.

